{"2953540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Neverseas", "steam_appid": 2953540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Age of Discovery, amid rumors of new lands, vanished fleets, and untold riches, there arose a legend of the Neverseas — a world beyond the known maps, hidden behind a veil of mist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a long time the tale was dismissed as a fable. But when the first travelers found their way there and back, the great powers could no longer afford to ignore the rumors. Armadas, merchants, mercenaries, and adventurers set sail beyond the horizon. And so began a new race for power, resources, and trade routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neverseas is an adventure action RPG about a captain, a ship, and the struggle for influence across uncharted seas. Explore islands, wage battles at sea, make landfall, join sieges, trade, plunder, forge alliances, and bend the world's economy to your own ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/54b5bf79a838699d4fb6499fa187e317.avif?t=1780309809\" width=1000 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/bd5b7c65aecd5a0d862ceb43baaec17a.poster.avif?t=1780309809\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/bd5b7c65aecd5a0d862ceb43baaec17a.webm?t=1780309809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/bd5b7c65aecd5a0d862ceb43baaec17a.mp4?t=1780309809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture beyond the known maps — to where the mist conceals new lands, ancient ruins, sunken ships, and perilous routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore islands, seek out rare resources, chart new paths, and confront mysteries that for centuries have lain beyond the reach of the known powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/6e94bd89339ba2610a5c61626c1df569.avif?t=1780309809\" width=1000 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/841defad877512fb7883b6bd433ae03f.poster.avif?t=1780309809\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/841defad877512fb7883b6bd433ae03f.webm?t=1780309809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/841defad877512fb7883b6bd433ae03f.mp4?t=1780309809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship is more than a means of travel. It is your home, your weapon, and the foundation of your future influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your vessel, gather your crew, and upgrade the hull, sails, armament, and rigging. Make the decisions that will determine the outcome of your voyage, the state of your crew, and your place in the world of the Neverseas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/2d5406f10feec018c3c2cc3f8586b250.avif?t=1780309809\" width=1000 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/c94ab068c016490ef8e2a7f63412e215.poster.avif?t=1780309809\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/c94ab068c016490ef8e2a7f63412e215.webm?t=1780309809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/c94ab068c016490ef8e2a7f63412e215.mp4?t=1780309809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Neverseas, trade, war, and politics are bound together.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haul cargo, supply settlements, intercept enemy shipments, and shape the flow of commerce. Engage in naval battles, maneuver under fire, pick your moment for a broadside, and win the advantage through cunning as much as through force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when cannons are not enough, make landfall, take part in land battles and sieges, and seize control of key strongholds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/1db82eb7ba73143a46e969596918c106.avif?t=1780309809\" width=1000 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/0d6b00f18a0c5184a00da747af6b8b2c.poster.avif?t=1780309809\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/0d6b00f18a0c5184a00da747af6b8b2c.webm?t=1780309809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/0d6b00f18a0c5184a00da747af6b8b2c.mp4?t=1780309809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with a single ship and gradually forge it into a force to be reckoned with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge alliances, take sides in the conflicts of the factions, develop trade hubs, expand your influence, and harness the world's economy to shift the balance of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Neverseas, every decision carries a price: a bargain struck, a raid, a disrupted supply line, or a battle won may prove the first step toward building a maritime power of your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure action RPG set in a world of sailing ships, factions, and uncharted seas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naval battles with maneuvering, broadsides, and ship upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Landings, sieges, and land engagements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Economic simulation: resources, trade routes, prices, and faction influence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of islands, ruins, sunken ships, and anomalies in the mist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The freedom to trade, plunder, wage war, forge alliances, and build influence of your own</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to take command of a ship and uncover what the mist conceals?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Age of Discovery, amid rumors of new lands, vanished fleets, and untold riches, there arose a legend of the Neverseas — a world beyond the known maps, hidden behind a veil of mist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a long time the tale was dismissed as a fable. But when the first travelers found their way there and back, the great powers could no longer afford to ignore the rumors. Armadas, merchants, mercenaries, and adventurers set sail beyond the horizon. And so began a new race for power, resources, and trade routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neverseas is an adventure action RPG about a captain, a ship, and the struggle for influence across uncharted seas. Explore islands, wage battles at sea, make landfall, join sieges, trade, plunder, forge alliances, and bend the world's economy to your own ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/54b5bf79a838699d4fb6499fa187e317.avif?t=1780309809\" width=1000 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/bd5b7c65aecd5a0d862ceb43baaec17a.poster.avif?t=1780309809\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/bd5b7c65aecd5a0d862ceb43baaec17a.webm?t=1780309809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/bd5b7c65aecd5a0d862ceb43baaec17a.mp4?t=1780309809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture beyond the known maps — to where the mist conceals new lands, ancient ruins, sunken ships, and perilous routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore islands, seek out rare resources, chart new paths, and confront mysteries that for centuries have lain beyond the reach of the known powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/6e94bd89339ba2610a5c61626c1df569.avif?t=1780309809\" width=1000 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.