paragraph\" >Haul cargo, supply settlements, intercept enemy shipments, and shape the flow of commerce. Engage in naval battles, maneuver under fire, pick your moment for a broadside, and win the advantage through cunning as much as through force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when cannons are not enough, make landfall, take part in land battles and sieges, and seize control of key strongholds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/1db82eb7ba73143a46e969596918c106.avif?t=1780309809\" width=1000 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/0d6b00f18a0c5184a00da747af6b8b2c.poster.avif?t=1780309809\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/0d6b00f18a0c5184a00da747af6b8b2c.webm?t=1780309809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/extras/0d6b00f18a0c5184a00da747af6b8b2c.mp4?t=1780309809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with a single ship and gradually forge it into a force to be reckoned with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge alliances, take sides in the conflicts of the factions, develop trade hubs, expand your influence, and harness the world's economy to shift the balance of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Neverseas, every decision carries a price: a bargain struck, a raid, a disrupted supply line, or a battle won may prove the first step toward building a maritime power of your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure action RPG set in a world of sailing ships, factions, and uncharted seas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naval battles with maneuvering, broadsides, and ship upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Landings, sieges, and land engagements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Economic simulation: resources, trade routes, prices, and faction influence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of islands, ruins, sunken ships, and anomalies in the mist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The freedom to trade, plunder, wage war, forge alliances, and build influence of your own</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to take command of a ship and uncover what the mist conceals?</strong></p>", "short_description": "Neverseas is a tactical action-RPG set in an open sea world. Command your ship, engage in battles, explore the lands beyond the ocean gates, and shape a global conflict between empires. Will you uncover the secrets of the seas—or vanish with your crew in this ruthless war?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/411bd232c7de6b1f4e7ef6d581aab725524eaa8c/header.jpg?t=1780309809", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/1bb8248cf31e13012e6bb741ef6b48ff2d7876e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780309809", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953540/1bb8248cf31e13012e6bb741ef6b48ff2d7876e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780309809", "website": "https://neverseas.ru/en/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</s